{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>Remove from there, etc.</b> From his words it is proven that his portion would consist only of speckled and spotted among the sheep and goats, and brown among the sheep, but ring-straked ones are not his portion. Yet from what Scripture says immediately afterward, it implies that he also took the ring-straked:" "<b>And it appears</b> that Jacob, when he stipulated, did not want to take ring-straked ones for his portion. His reason is that if he were to take the ring-straked ones as well, he would need to remove them too from Laban's flock, and from that point on there would be no sign of the white in all the flock for the flock to conceive toward them, and he would be laboring in vain — for it never entered Jacob's mind to deceive Laban in any way whatsoever. He reckoned that through the agency of the ring-straked [animals] it would come about that the flock would conceive and give birth also to the speckled and spotted that he was taking for himself. And so you will find that Scripture says (Genesis 30:40) ״וַיִּתֵּן פְּנֵי הַצֹּאן אֶל עָקוֹד״ — and they were giving birth to speckled and spotted and brown, that they conceived toward the rod; and the deceiver Laban was clever toward this knowledge and took everything ring-straked, speckled, and spotted. He was further clever and removed all that was Laban's in it — his bones swelled [with outrage], for that was not the condition. For if so, from where would ring-straked or speckled or spotted come forth, and consequently Jacob's wage was void? For this reason Jacob was clever to take the wage of his toil and set up the rods, and he took for himself also the ring-straked ones — for by the fact that Laban had removed them, he revealed his mind that in these lay Jacob's portion. And this is what it says (Genesis 30:39) ״וַתֵּלַדְנָה הַצֹּאן עֲקֻדִּים נְקֻדִּים וּטְלוּאִים״ — and all three kinds were in Jacob's portion, and concerning Laban it is said (Proverbs 5:22) ״וּבְחַבְלֵי חַטָּאתוֹ יִתָּמֵךְ״."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:45:12.314936111Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}